  "_comment": "Books (§4.6). Nothing here stacks: every copy rolls its own page count (§4.6.4) and keeps its own progress_pages (§4.6.3). weight_kg and volume_l are the mid-length copy, present because §4.1 requires both of every item; the real ones come from pages × g_per_page + cover_g at the moment the instance is generated, which is why the encyclopedia can weigh 2 kg. xp_per_page, not xp_per_title: a 400-page manual must not pay the same as a 150-page one for three times the reading (§4.6.4). The four skills are §7.1's.",
